WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.860
In the park, Ola meets the boy who lives next door.

2
00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.670
Cześć! Jak masz na imię?

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.800
Mam na imię Kuba.

4
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.130
Ile masz lat, Kuba?

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.600
She asks his age. Word for word: how many years do you have?

6
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Mam osiem lat. A ty?

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.860
Ja mam dwadzieścia dwa lata.

8
00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Listen again to the last word. It changed.

9
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.080
Mam dwadzieścia dwa lata.

10
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.400
The word for years depends on the number.

11
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:41.830
After a number ending in two, three or four, it takes a longer form.

12
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.860
With most other numbers it takes the short form.

13
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.540
Ask a friend how old they are.

14
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.400
Ile masz lat?

15
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.760
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

16
00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.920
Ile masz lat?

17
00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.840
You are twenty years old. Say it.

18
00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:13.820
Mam dwadzieścia lat.

19
00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:18.180
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

20
00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.460
Mam dwadzieścia lat.

21
00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:27.020
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
